// Expected: c1 at one session and at two, also under --auto-queries.
//
// The scenario rebinds secret to other in Alice only. Bob still knows the
// original secret and leaks it. The automatic queries once dropped secret
// because a scenario names it, asked only about other, and passed.
attacker[passive]
principal Alice[
	knows private secret, other
	_ = HASH(secret)
]
principal Bob[
	knows private secret
	leaks secret
]
scenarios[Alice[secret = other]]
queries[
	confidentiality? secret
]
